WEBVTT

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.910
Templum...

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.540
Mundus...

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:15.980
Infini...

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:17.520
Tum...

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.180
Redire!

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:32.130
7 Primevals fused with human hosts and attacked the GGG Orbit Base.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.100
Of these seven, five were Purified, and once returned to human form...

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.300
...they were transported back to Earth on the J-Ark.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.780
Several weeks later...

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.610
...on the island of Izu...

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:52.840
...children on a field trip for fossils are about to discover something.

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:56.760
This strata here is 65 million years old!

00:00:56.830 --> 00:01:00.450
In other words, it's from the time when the dinosaurs died out!

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:04.160
65 million years, did you say? How long ago is that?

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.220
Just look it up, will you?

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.890
Oh, look! What do you suppose that is?

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:09.460
What could it be?

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:15.840
Son of Cain, Latio!

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:18.750
I'm Mamoru Amami, and I'm from Earth!

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.020
I'm...

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.310
I'm...

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:29.020
Mamoru...

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:34.250
What should I do?

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.790
What the heck is this!

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.430
This is no fossil, guys! It's steel.

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:43.000
Look! There's some over here, too!

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:49.710
Blue and red?

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:56.040
ChoRyuJin?

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:59.290
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:02.190
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:09.050
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:13.810
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:20.040
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:24.130
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:28.830
to save the future of outer space.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:32.790
It's time to launch!

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.970
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:39.890
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:44.590
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:47.550
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:50.470
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:53.220
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:56.730
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:00.400
Goldion Hammer!

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:07.930
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:13.930
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.750
Our very own King of Braves!

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:20.930
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:24.900
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:28.040
Return from an Ancient Era

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.800
<i>Return from an Ancient Era</i>

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.350
Big Brother HyoRyu!

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:44.480
Big Brother EnRyu!

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:48.890
Still, for the life of me I can't figure it out.

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:53.220
In order to prevent the asteroid from crash-landing here on Earth...

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:57.170
...he sacrificed himself and vanished on the other side of the universe.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.670
So how did he...

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:03.070
...end up buried underneath layers of rock from 65 million years ago?

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.070
The results of my analysis are in.

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:07.610
What's it look like?

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:12.050
His outer body has degraded significantly, and is no longer viable.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.720
But the GS-Ride is still functioning.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.590
His A.I. system, while severely damaged, is also intact.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.330
Then that means...

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:20.590
He's alive, right?

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:21.720
ChoRyuJin's alive!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:22.920
Waha!

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:27.870
In addition, I've detected an unknown energy source that's not G-Power.

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:29.400
Unknown energy?

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.830
Apparently this energy...

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:37.210
...has protected the GS-Ride and the A.I. system all this time.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.250
Ah...

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:43.750
The energy that preserved ChoRyuJin for 65 million long years...

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.220
What on earth could it be?

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:48.680
Around this time, at the GGG Orbit Base...

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:52.890
...Izanagi is about to be launched to transport the Zonder Crystals to...

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:56.560
...the Cerne Central Laboratory in Switzerland.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.770
An experiment to analyze the Zonder Crystal's properties, huh?

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:03.960
And the only accelerator that can carry out such a task is in Cerne.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:08.580
It's more than likely that you'll encounter the Primevals on your way.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:11.010
Gai, I'm counting on you to protect the ship!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:11.980
Roger!

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:15.020
Goldymarg's coming along, so that makes us pretty much invincible!

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:19.980
Hey! I'll be standing guard over the Orbit Base, so there's nothing to fear!

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:24.390
As soon as the experiment's done, I'm going to go see ChoRyuJin.

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:28.890
I don't know how he managed to do it, but he came back like he promised.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.830
I just want to say "Welcome home!" to him.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.500
Certainly, go right ahead.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.940
You be careful, Gai, all right?

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:37.660
Sure.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:42.240
Ul-tech Engine Drive Space Carrier Base, Izanagi, separate and launch!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:52.720
I-It's you again.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.520
But why are you crying?

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.530
Are you trying to tell me that I shouldn't go?

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.300
It's just an illusion.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:09.060
There must be some kind of data bug in my cyborg circuit's...

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.500
...image-processing chip, that's all.

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:16.540
As soon as I get back to Earth, I'll have Dad give me a tune-up.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.710
Still, it makes me wonder...

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:21.480
That sad look on her face...

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:31.220
Command...

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:34.660
Zonder Metal Plant, activate now!

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:37.560
Just leave it to us, Pagliaccio!

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:40.940
Now that the Ultimate Seven Primevals have gone down in defeat...

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.330
...we cannot afford to make any more mistakes.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.500
This mission must succeed at all costs!

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:48.170
Are you ready, Stomach?

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.710
Come now, have no fear.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:58.080
For the time being, we're completely safe from being detected.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.520
Now then, let me get started on my side as well.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.990
As long as I stay hidden at the bottom of the gravity well...

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:06.890
...no one will ever find us!

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.700
We'll be there in another 20 minutes or so.

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:20.100
Looks like we're going to make it in one piece!

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:24.270
There's a gigantic flying vessel up ahead!

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:25.870
A Primeval?

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:27.440
No, that's got to be...

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:30.380
The J-Ark!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.260
Fusion!

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.160
Fusion!

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:46.290
Stand up!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.180
J-Der!

00:07:58.150 --> 00:07:59.940
GaiGar!

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.240
What do you want?

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:07.150
The Zonder Crystal! Why don't you hand it over now?

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:10.580
What are you planning to do once you've collected all the crystals?

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:12.490
I don't have to answer that question!

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:17.020
But we share the goal of destroying the 31 Machine Primevals!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.760
Why can't you join forces with us?

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.200
Because we're Abel's warriors.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:24.860
As far as the fate of the Blue Planet goes, we don't give a damn!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.000
In that case, I can't hand over those crystals.

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:31.140
The promise we made when we lost our mother planet...

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:33.870
...it's not something you'd ever understand.

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.240
I'm taking those crystals by force no matter what!

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.080
Mega-fusion!

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:47.690
It's the signal requesting Final Fusion approval!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.120
Right.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.760
Final Fusion, approved!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:52.930
Roger!

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:54.430
Final Fusion!

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.900
Program...

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:02.000
What's the matter, Ms. Utsugi?

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:05.010
I-I'm fine!

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:06.680
Final Fusion...

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:08.980
Program Drive!

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:16.350
Final Fusion!

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:08.100
King J-Der!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:22.610
GaoGaiGar!

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:31.420
Out of my way!

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.270
I hope you didn't forget about me!

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.510
Goldymarg!

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:55.380
Broken Magnum!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.290
Generating Armor, full power!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.790
The Broken Magnum didn't put a dent in him!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:10.630
G and J...

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.560
Destroy their nerve centers!

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:43.030
Primevals!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.370
We'll pick this up another time!

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:55.710
Broken Magnum!

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.180
Antimeson Cannons!

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:09.590
Wh-What's this?

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:10.460
Is it a trap?

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:14.570
I've lost all control of Izanagi!

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.030
I-It's got me, too.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:20.240
I can't control my own body!

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:21.970
Goldymarg!

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:24.880
I can't move!

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.310
Boost the output of the Jewel Generator!

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:33.210
Power decreasing. Foreign-body reaction. J-Fibers... crossed...

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:35.910
J!

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:40.050
Is it that sand causing this?

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:44.820
The sand that has adhered to the armor of GaoGaiGar and the others.

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:49.060
It is causing interference in their nerve centers, the G-Fibers...

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:51.700
...crossing up all signal transfers...

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:54.000
...and thwarting control of their own bodies.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.510
They are crystals with a terrible power!

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:06.050
G and J, annihilate!

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:18.760
Symmetrical Docking!

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:21.230
Three Become One!

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.410
Big Volfogg, as well as GekiRyuJin...

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.100
You are hereby ordered to join Susanoh!

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:31.770
Launch an attack against the 31 Machine Primevals in Giza, Egypt!

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:35.210
Mic, along with the Twin-Hulled Supply and Maintenance Ship, Amaterasu.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:38.310
I'm sending you to retrieve Izanagi from the Atlantic Ocean!

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:42.890
GekiRyuJin!

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:49.230
Big Volfogg!

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:55.000
Be careful! I don't think there's just one Primeval out there!

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.460
Understood.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.900
We're going now, Big Brother!

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:00.500
Ul-Tech Engine on!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:01.940
Begin ascent!

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:08.950
Big Volfogg and GekiRyuJin have completed docking.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:11.140
All right! Susanoh, launch!

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.620
ChoRyuJin...

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:29.160
GGG Ship, Susanoh, headed for Egypt!

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.600
Just as we'd planned...

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:38.500
I'm sure they have no clue the same thing is happening here in Mexico.

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:47.350
The enemy's powers are incalculable. We mustn't let our guard down!

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:50.290
I'm not the type to sit around waiting. Let's go!

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.130
We've been waiting for you.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.330
You wretched G-Stone robots!

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:10.940
Murasame Sword!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:17.080
C-Could this be a solution capable of subverting molecular structure?

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.640
Big Volfogg!

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.550
You mustn't come near me!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.320
My G-Liquid...

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.660
Now you've gone and done it! You cursed Primevals!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:36.840
Roar, Hurricane! Split the sky, Lightning!

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:39.210
Shuang Tou Long!

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.410
My Shuang Tou Long...

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:51.620
You fool! I know all about your powers.

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:17.900
I'm sensing Primevals somewhere else!

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:22.750
Primevals have appeared in Mexico as well.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.640
Are they planning to splinter our troops?

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:30.590
Mic Robots the 1st to the 12th, now undergoing post-Disc X overhaul!

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:34.190
They'll need at least another 10 minutes before they can mobilize.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:38.260
We can't even use Susanoh's reflector beam up in the atmosphere.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.900
Sound Sonar!

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:49.840
Where are you, GaoGaiGar?

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.640
There's no time to lose, man!

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:04.960
If only ChoRyuJin could go out there now...

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:08.930
Even if he regained consciousness, his whole body's been fossilized.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.430
There's no way he could go into battle in that condition.

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:19.660
Two different Primevals, eh?

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:25.540
Hey, listen, I know how dangerous that sand is!

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:33.350
The Primeval in Mexico is...

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:37.720
...inhaling a tropical cyclone brewing in the ocean with that huge tube!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:42.430
Don't tell me it's going to use the energy from that hurricane...

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:45.490
...to transform itself into a Zonder Metal Plant?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:48.390
Does that mean the Pyramid Primeval in Egypt is also...

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:52.870
No! It's sucking in solar energy with...

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:55.500
...the gravity lens coming out of his arm!

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.040
Just as we thought, then...

00:17:57.110 --> 00:18:00.740
People are being captured by the Primevals one after another!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.540
If we use the Primeval Core-geared Disc X...

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:06.140
Near the Egyptian pyramids there's a...

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:09.250
...sandstorm raging that can scramble electric signals.

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.760
And by the Mexican pyramids...

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:13.820
...a gravity field as powerful as a black hole has been created!

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:17.690
So they're out to seal the Solitary Wave again, like before?

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:21.590
Damn!

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:25.570
So if we get trapped by that sandstorm we'll end up like Izanagi!

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:28.030
We can't make a move from here, either!

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:32.380
Unless Mic finds GaoGaiGar and the others with his Sound Sonar...

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:36.140
Who could've imagined they'd contain our forces and then build their...

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.690
...Zonder Metal Plants in two different locations at once.

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:40.440
And now our last hope is...

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:43.620
There's no one but me now, huh?

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:53.560
Symmetrical Out!

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:55.100
FuRyu!

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.130
RaiRyu!

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:08.110
This battle's gonna be rough.

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:12.320
But we can't run away from it, or else Big Brother EnRyu...

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:14.410
Big Brother HyoRyu...

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:15.980
We'll never be able to face them.

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:18.590
I'm going to stay and fight here in Egypt.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:19.420
Gotcha!

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.860
Make sure you stay alive, FuRyu!

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:25.660
Same goes for you, RaiRyu!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.360
Feng Dao Dan!

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.080
I've reached Mexico!

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:48.580
TiGao 4!

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:50.960
Rei!

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:56.490
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:02.330
I've got you now!

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:15.740
So there were two other Primevals here, too?

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:31.560
I've got to hurry or the Metal Plant will be finished.

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:35.000
TiGao 3!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:36.660
Dou Nu!

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:47.510
There's no way you'll be able to stop two Zonder Metal Plants!

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:50.410
You're going down in defeat!

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:02.630
What can I do at a time like this?

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:04.500
What can I do?

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:38.260
ChoRyuJin...

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:42.430
Please, lend us your power!

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:57.050
What's this? This isn't G-Stone-generated energy!

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:07.360
Wh-What just...

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:09.360
What just happened?

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:21.340
ChoRyuJin!

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:31.680
Across a span of 65 million years, ChoRyuJin has been resurrected!

00:22:32.390 --> 00:22:36.790
With a mysterious energy flowing throughout his entire body...

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:40.790
...can this new ChoRyuJin be the one to blaze the trail to victory?

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:47.830
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:50.160
ChoRyuJin has been resurrected!

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:54.500
An energy source from outer space still unknown to mankind, Za Powa!

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:55.660
Wind and Fire!

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:57.100
Ice and Lightning!

00:23:57.570 --> 00:23:59.060
Even the Primevals tremble in fear...

00:23:59.140 --> 00:24:02.670
...now that 2 of the most powerful Brave Robot combos have been born!

00:24:03.140 --> 00:24:05.170
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.310 --> 00:24:07.470
"GenRyuJin, GouRyuJin"

00:24:06.450 --> 00:24:06.490
GenRyuJin, GouRyuJin

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:10.180
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:13.020 --> 00:24:14.660
This is the Key to Victory!
